-</text>
-<text><para>GST                                         $     80.64</para>
-</text>
-<text><para>Disbursements                          $     53.67</para>
-</text>
-<text><para>TOTAL FEES</para>
-<para>AND DISBURSEMENTS              $3,509.53</para>
-</text>
-<text><para>Peter McCallum</para>
-<para>Legal Counsel</para>
